/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
/*			
			
	Copyright © 2006 DVY_RigVehicle. All rights reserved davvey@ntlworld.com
					
						- DVY_RigVehicle -
	
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
						  
	This script will build Vehicle rigg for wheel rotation, suspension
	and steering. This script is called by the GUI DVY_Vehicle Rigger.mel

	This script current has minimal error checking but if you find it useful please
	let me know and I will rewrite it with full error checking.
	
	This script was written to demonstrate the use of Utility nodes to replace
	expressions foor vehicle control etc.
	
	I am currently working on building a full suite ot scripts to allow rigging
	of all the various parts of any wheeled vehicle. The intention is to build a
	set of "modular" scripts to allow rigging oif individual parts and or a fullly
	rigged vehicle.
	
	Directions:
	
	Source and run DVY_Vehicle Rigger.mel, use default values is you have named them 
	as shown or selct each item in turn and load required field. Also you can type names
	in the field as required. Script will error out if not all items are found.
	Once all fields correct press "Rig Vehicle" button. 
	
	Each Tab must be initialized by selecting the relevant CheckBox on the first Tab.
	To set up the Doors and Hood Section, select the required items using the check
	boxes, then select the items or use default values (same as wheel section method).
	Once all field completed press the "Set Hinge Position" Button on that Tab.
	Repeat for Hood etc Tab if required , then adjust position of the Blue Spheres to
	the exact position you want the Hinge point to be. Then adjust the Red Spheres to
	the `Handle` position for item item. The Blue Spheres can be Translated and Rotated,
	the Red just Translated. The Red handle sphere is used to set the angle of rotation
	of the Hinge. The limit of opening angle is 110 degrees but this can be changed 
	using the Controllers `Y` Translate Axis limits in the Attribute Editor
	
	The Window Spheres (green and Yellow) carry out a similar function but are used
	to set up a sliding action to simulate Window opening.
	
	Structure of intial Vehicle is as follows :-
	
	Vehicle Top Node
	 |___
		|
		|___BodyShell Group
			|
		  	|_____BodyWork_Group 
		  	|	  |
		  	|	  |__Door_GrpN_1
			|	  |	 |
		  	|	  |	 |__LfFr_Door_GrpN_1
			|	  |	 |__RtFr_Door_GrpN_1
			|	  |	 |__LfRr_Door_GrpN_1
			|	  |	 |__RtRr_Door_GrpN_1 
			|	  |
			|	  |__Fr_Hood_GrpN_1
			|	  |__Rr_Trunk_GrpN_1 or Rr_Tailgate_GrpN_1 
			|	  |
			|	  |					 or	(Rr_TopTailgate_GrpN_1
			|	  |						 Rr_BotTailgate_GrpN_1)
			|	  |
			|	  |					 or (LfRr_Tailgate_GrpN_1
			|	  |						 RtRr_TailDoor_GrpN_1)
			|	  |
			|	  |
			|	  |__Remaining Chassis parts(contains all geometry except Wheels.
			|
		  	|___Wheels Grp_1 
			  	|___
					|Fr_Wheels_Grp_1
					|	|
					|	|__ LfFr_Wheel_Grp_1	(Wheel Group Naming must follow
					|	|__ RtFr_Wheel_Grp_1	  this structure i.e 
					|	|__ LfFr_Wheel_Grp_2	  LfFr_Wheel_Grp_1,  LfFr_Wheel _Grp_2
					|	|__ RtFr_Wheel_Grp_2	  order is not important within each of
					|							  the Group Nodes.)
					|Rr_Wheels_Grp_1
						|
						|__ LfRr_Wheel_Grp_1
						|__ RtRr_Wheel_Grp_1
						|__ LfRr_Wheel_Grp_2
						|__ RtRr_Wheel_Grp_2	
							
			
	Basic Procedure:
		Main procedure uses a $GroupV_A to store main groups from GUI and 
		build a rig of joints with locators as reuired.
		Joints are constrained to individual locators.
		Also some locators are constrained to individual joints.
		
		Wheels can be individually controlled based on distnace moved or set
		to spin based on time (see help file for more info).
		
		There are 4 Main "Rig Contollers" plus auxillary Controllers.
		
		Rig_ControllerN_1 :-
		
			Controls movement and rotation of main vehicle.
			Also houses attributes for setting range of suspension travel
			using attribute Piston Range. Also there are also individual
			range settings for each wheel(not active yet).
		
		Steering_ControllerN_1 
		
			Controls steering for Front and Rear Wheels. The front steering
			is active by default, to activate Rear steering set "Rr Steer"
			to On. Setting the "Fr Steer Ratio" and "Rr Steer Ratios" to a 
			negative value will reverse direction of rotation.
			Set "Fr Steer to Off will set vehicle to have rerar steering.
			The ratio can be set anywhere between -1 and 1, this will
			reduce effect of rotation to simulat the Rear wheel steer you
			now see on some high performance cars.
		
		Bank_ControllerN_1
		
			This will Bank the Vehicle by a mavximum of 5 degrees in both 
			X and Z +/- axis and still allow full susupension control.
			The maximum range can be altered in the attribute editor by adjusting
			the X and Z axis rotate limits.
			
		VehicleTilt_ControllerN_1
		
			This will tilt the Chassis group as reguired. Also each indiviual
			Wheel can be moved up and down by moving each wheel Group Ground 
			Locator to simulate ground variations.
			
			Also if Doors and Hand and TRunk Options are selected then there will
			be individual controllers for each Door or BodyShell Section. Plus
			individual controllers for each opening window (sliding open).
			
		Auxillary Controllers 
			(For Door, Window, Front Hood and Rear Runk or Tailgate)
			
			The Auxillary Controllers are set up for each individual section i.e.
			Left Front passenger Door, Right Front Passenger Door. If required
			a Window Controller will be added as required. The controls are set
			up so that transaltion in the Horizontal direction will drive the
			opening or closing by rotation of the relevant section or item.
			The Window Contollers work in the Vertical direction and open the
			window by a sliding action.
	
		Floor Control

			There is an option to set up an automatic wheel control for each
			wheel by setting up a Geometry Constaint to a "Ground Plane".
			This has an auto ON/OFF setup which releases the wheels once car
			leaves the ground a distance greater than suspension travel.
			
		Motion Path
		
			To setup Vehicle to Motion Path. Select Rig_Controller and Motion
			Path. This will set up and parent a locator under Vehicle Top Node
			and constrain the Rig Controls to the motion path via the locator.
			The remain controls will operate as usual and wheels will either 
			auto rotate based on movement or based on wheel spin settings
			
*/	

//						TestData	
/*		
	string $Groups[] = {"", "DavveyTruck"};
	global float $DVYdata[];
	
		$DVYdata[1] = 2;		//	No. of Front Wheels
		$DVYdata[2] = 3;		//	No.of Rear Wheels
		$DVYdata[10] = 0;		//	Trailer Bogie steering	 
		
		DVY_RigVehicle ($Groups, $DVYdata);
*/		

//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//					DVY_RigVehicle Procedure
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

//============================================================================
//	GLOBAL VARIABLES
//============================================================================
	global int $DVYDebug;

// Integer Flag that allows print statements to be output to
// message field for tracking purposes.

//============================================================================
	
global proc DVY_RigVehicle(string $GroupV_A[], float $DVYdata[])
 {
	print "Start of DVY_RigVehicle Procedure.\n";

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Global Variables

	global string  $GroupD_A[], $GroupV_A[]; clear $GroupV_A;
	global string $RigControlsA[]; clear $RigControlsA;
	global string $DLocs[], $DJntsA[], $LocGroups[], $DVY_MuSuspGrp[];
	clear $DJntsA; clear $DLocs;
	
	global string $hier[], $LChier[], $JThier[];
	global string $DVY_VehName;
	
	global int $On = 1;
	
	global float $DVYdata[];	
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Local Variables

	float $VDataA[], $BDataA[], $SDataA[], $WDataFrA[], $WDataRrA[], $TDataA[];
	int $a, $b, $c, $i, $j, $k, $l, $q, $r, $s, $t, $v, $idx;
	string $DJntsA[], $DLocs[], $Groups[], $LocGroups[], $DLayers[], $Tmp[], $Sel[], $DVYSel[];

	string $DPrefixSp[] = {"LfFr_", "RtFr_", "LfRr_", "RtRr_"};
	string $DPrefix[] = {"LfFr", "RtFr", "LfRr", "RtRr"};
	string $WJntA[] = {"Wheel_JnTA_", "Wheel_JnTB_", "Wheel_JnTC_", "Wheel_JnTD_", "Wheel_JnTE_"};
	string $SJntA[] = {"Susp_JnTA_", "Susp_JnTB_", "Susp_JnTC_"};
	string $WLocA[] = {"Wheel_LocA_", "Wheel_LocB_", "Wheel_LocC_", "Wheel_LocD_", "Wheel_LocE_", "Wheel_LocGrd_"};
	string $SLocA[] = {"Susp_LocA_", "Susp_LocB_", "Susp_LocC_", "Susp_LocD_", "Susp_LocE_", "Susp_LocGrd_"};

// Custom attributes to Rig Controls for spin, steer, suspension, move and rotate.
	
	string $DVYAttrA[] = {"WheelSpin_", "AutoRotate_"};
	string $DVYAttrB[] = {"RotateAngle", "PlusAngle", "NegAngle"};
	string $DVYAttrC[] = {"GrdDist", "GrdLimit", "JtDist", "TyreFlat", "SuspMax", "SuspMin", "MaxTr", "MinTr"};
	string $DVYAttrD[] = {"Move_MultSqNX_Out", "Move_MultSqNZ_Out", "MoveRig_AddN_Out",
							"MoveRig_SqRtN_Out", "XZMoveCondN_Out", "XZMoveCond_AddN_Out",
							"XZSumN_Out", "XMoveCondN_Out", "ZMoveCondN_Out", "RotateDirection"};
	
	string $DVYAttrE[] = {"WheelSpinMultiply", "WheelSpinCalc", "SpinWheelInValue"};
	string $DVYAttrF[] = {"PistonRange", "GrdDist", "JtDist", "MaxTr", "MinTr", "SuspMax", "SuspMin"};
	string $DVYAttrG[] = {"TiltEnable", "TiltPosOrient", "TiltNegOrient", "PlusTiltAngle", "NegTiltAngle", "TiltPos", "TiltNeg"};
	string $DVYAttrh[] = {"SuspMax", "SuspMin", "GrdDist", "JtDist", "MaxTr", "MinTr"};
 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Constants and "Static Data"

	$DVYdata[1] = `intSliderGrp -q -v FrontAxleSlider`;
	$DVYdata[2] = `intSliderGrp -q -v RearAxleSlider`;

	$DVY_VehName = `textField -q -tx VehicleGrpNameTextField`;
	
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Calculated Data
		
	
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Display Layer for completed rig.
	
					
		if (!`objExists "JointsLayer"`)
			{ $DLayers[3] = `createDisplayLayer -name "JointsLayer" -number 5 -empty`;}
				else {$DLayers[3] = "JointsLayer";} 
					setAttr ($DLayers[3] + ".displayType") 2;
					setAttr ($DLayers[3] + ".visibility") 0;
		
		if (!`objExists "LocatorsLayer" `) 
			{$DLayers[2] = `createDisplayLayer -name "LocatorsLayer" -number 4 -empty`;}
				else {$DLayers[2] = "LocatorsLayer";} 
					setAttr ($DLayers[2] + ".displayType") 2;
					setAttr ($DLayers[2] + ".visibility") 0; 
					
		if (!`objExists "LowRes_GeomLayer"`)
			{$DLayers[4] = `createDisplayLayer -name "LowRes_GeomLayer" -number 3 -empty`;}
				else {$DLayers[4] = "LowRes_GeomLayer";}			
					setAttr ($DLayers[4] + ".displayType") 2;
					setAttr ($DLayers[4] + ".visibility") 1; 
		
		if (!`objExists "GeomLayer" `) 
			{$DLayers[1] = `createDisplayLayer -name "GeomLayer" -number 2 -empty`;}
				else {$DLayers[1] = "GeomLayer";}			
					setAttr ($DLayers[1] + ".displayType") 2;
					setAttr ($DLayers[1] + ".visibility") 1; 
		
		if (!`objExists "RigControlLayer" `) 
			{$DLayers[0] = `createDisplayLayer -name "RigControlLayer" -number 1 -empty`;}
				else {$DLayers[0] = "RigControlLayer";}
					setAttr ($DLayers[0] + ".displayType") 0;
					setAttr ($DLayers[0] + ".visibility") 1; 
					
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Section to Build Groups and parent sections as required.
					
	string $Num;

	$GroupV_A[0] = `textField -q -tx VehicleTopNodeTxField`;
		$GroupV_A[0] = `rename $GroupV_A[0] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[0])`;
	
	$GroupV_A[1] = `textField -q -tx VehicleBodyShellGrpTxField`;
		catch (`parent $GroupV_A[1] $GroupV_A[0]`);
		$GroupV_A[1] = `rename $GroupV_A[1] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[1])`;
			
	$GroupV_A[2] = `textField -q -tx VehicleBodyShellTxField`;
		catch (`parent $GroupV_A[2] $GroupV_A[1]`);
		$GroupV_A[2] = `rename $GroupV_A[2] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[2])`;
				
	select -cl;
		
		if (!`objExists "Wheels_Grp_1" `) 
			{ $GroupV_A[3] = `group -em -name Wheels_Grp_1`; }
			else {$GroupV_A[3] = "Wheels_Grp_1";}
				catch (`parent $GroupV_A[3] $GroupV_A[1]`);
				$GroupV_A[3] = `rename $GroupV_A[3] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[3])`;
			
		if (!`objExists "Fr_Wheels_Grp_1" `) 
			{ $GroupV_A[4] = `group -em -name Fr_Wheels_Grp_1`; }
			else {$GroupV_A[4] = "Fr_Wheels_Grp_1";}
				catch (`parent $GroupV_A[4] $GroupV_A[3]`);
				$GroupV_A[4] = `rename $GroupV_A[4] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[4])`;
	
		if (!`objExists "Rr_Wheels_Grp_1" `) 
			{ $GroupV_A[5] = `group -em -name Rr_Wheels_Grp_1`; }
			else {$GroupV_A[5] = "Rr_Wheels_Grp_1";}
				catch (`parent $GroupV_A[5] $GroupV_A[3]`);
				$GroupV_A[5] = `rename $GroupV_A[5] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[5])`;
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
		
		$GroupV_A[6] = `textField -q -tx LfFr_WheelTxField`;
			select $GroupV_A[6];
				catch (`parent $GroupV_A[6] $GroupV_A[4]`);
		
		
		for ($q=2; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
			{	
				$Num = $q;
				$GroupV_A[$q+5] = `substitute "1" $GroupV_A[6] $Num`;
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($q+5) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$q+5] + "\n");
				$GroupV_A[$q+5] = `rename $GroupV_A[$q+5] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$q+5])`;
					catch (`parent $GroupV_A[($q+5)] $GroupV_A[4]`);
				
			}
	
		$GroupV_A[6] = `rename $GroupV_A[6] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[6])`;
			
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	$c = $DVYdata[1]+6;
		print ("$c is " + $c + "\n"); 
		
	$GroupV_A[$c] = `textField -q -tx RtFr_WheelTxField`;
	$c--;
	print $GroupV_A;

	print ("$c is " + $c + "\n"); 
	
		for ($q=2; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
			{	
				$Num = $q;
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `substitute "1" $GroupV_A[$c+1] $Num`;
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($q+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$q+$c] + "\n");
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `rename $GroupV_A[$q+$c] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$q+$c])`;
					catch (`parent $GroupV_A[($q+$c)] $GroupV_A[4]`);
			}
			
		$GroupV_A[$c+1] = `rename $GroupV_A[$c+1] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$c+1])`;
	print $GroupV_A;
	
	$c = $DVYdata[1]*2+6;
		print ("$c is " + $c + "\n"); 
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

		$GroupV_A[$c] = `textField -q -tx LfRr_WheelTxField`;
		$c--;
		print ("$c is " + $c + "\n"); 

		print $GroupV_A;
	
		for ($q=2; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
			{	
				$Num = $q;
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `substitute "1" $GroupV_A[$c+1] $Num`;
				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($q+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$q+$c] + "\n");
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `rename $GroupV_A[$q+$c] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$q+$c])`;
					catch (`parent $GroupV_A[($q+$c)] $GroupV_A[5]`);
		}

			
		$GroupV_A[$c+1] = `rename $GroupV_A[$c+1] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$c+1])`;

	$c = ($q+$c++);
		print ("$c is " + $c + "\n"); 
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

		$GroupV_A[$c] = `textField -q -tx RtRr_WheelTxField`;
		print $GroupV_A;
		$c--;	
		for ($q=2; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
			{	
				$Num = $q;
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `substitute "1" $GroupV_A[$c+1] $Num`;
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($q+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$q+$c] + "\n");
				$GroupV_A[$q+$c] = `rename $GroupV_A[$q+$c] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$q+$c])`;
					catch (`parent $GroupV_A[($q+$c)] $GroupV_A[5]`);
			}
			$GroupV_A[$c+1] = `rename $GroupV_A[$c+1] ($DVY_VehName + $GroupV_A[$c+1])`;
				
		print ("$GroupV_A is:- \n"); $a=0;
			for ($each in $GroupV_A) {print ("$GroupV_A[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
			print (" © Davvey..\n");
		

		for ($i = 2; $i <`size ($GroupV_A)`;$i++)
			{ select -r $GroupV_A[$i]; CenterPivot;}
		
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create group nodes
			
// Collect data for Body postion and size.
				
	$BDataA = `objectCenter $GroupV_A[2]`;
	$TDataA = `xform -q -bb $GroupV_A[2]`;
	
		for ($s = 3; $s < 9; $s++ )
			{ $BDataA[$s] = $TDataA[($s-3)];}
//			print "BodyShell Data is \n"; print $BDataA; print "© Davvey..\n";

		
		$Groups[0] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_GrdN_1")`;
		$Groups[1] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_GrdRefN_1")`;
		$Groups[2] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Susp_LocGrpN_1")`;
		$Groups[3] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Wheel_LocGrpN_1")`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[3] $Groups[3]`;
		
		$Groups[4] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Fr_Wheel_LocGrpN_1")`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[4] $Groups[4]`;
		
		$Groups[5] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Rr_Wheel_LocGrpN_1")`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[5] $Groups[5]`;
		
		$Groups[6] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Susp_TopLocGrpN_1")`;	
		$Groups[7] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Joints_GrpN_1")`;	
		$Groups[8] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "VehicleRotate_LocGrpN_1")`;
		$Groups[9] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Dummy_GrpN_1")`;	// Create Dummy Group Node for auto spin setup.

		setAttr ($Groups[6] + ".translateY") $BDataA[4];
		setAttr ($Groups[7] + ".translateY") $BDataA[4];
		
		for ($i = 0; $i < 10; $i++) { parent $Groups[$i] $GroupV_A[0];}
		
		parent $Groups[4] $Groups[5] $Groups[3];
		
		$LocGroups[2] =  `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Fr_TopLoc_GrdN_1")`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[4] $LocGroups[2]`;
			parent $LocGroups[2] $Groups[6];
		
		$LocGroups[3] =  `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + "Rr_TopLoc_GrdN_1")`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[5] $LocGroups[3]`;
			parent $LocGroups[3] $Groups[6];

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create additional rotate Group Node for each wheel.
			
	$i = 0; $j = 0; $k = 0;
	$r = 0; 
	for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++)
		{ $q=1;
		for ($i=10; $i<10 + $DVYdata[1]; $i++)
			{ $r = 0;
			  $Groups[$i+$k] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefix[$a] + "_Wheel_GrpR_" + $q++)`;
				delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[$j+6] $Groups[$i+$k]`;
				makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
		    	$Sel = `listRelatives -children $GroupV_A[$j+6]`;
				for ($each in $Sel) {$Sel[$r++] = `rename $each ($DVY_VehName + $each)`;}
				parent $Groups[$i+$k] $GroupV_A[$j+6]; 				
			 	parent $Sel $Groups[$i+$k];
		        $j++;	$k++;
			}
			$k = $k - $DVYdata[1] + 1;
		}
	$b = (2* $DVYdata[1]);
	$i = 0; $j = 0; $k = 0;
	$r = 0; 
	
	for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++)
		{ $q=1;
		for ($i=10; $i<10 + $DVYdata[2]; $i++)
			{ $r = 0;
			  $Groups[$i+$k+$b] = `group -em -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefix[$a] + "_Wheel_GrpR_" + $q++)`;
				delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -weight 1 $GroupV_A[$j+6+$b] $Groups[$i+$k+$b]`;
				makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
		    	$Sel = `listRelatives -children $GroupV_A[$j+6+$b]`;
				for ($each in $Sel) {$Sel[$r++] = `rename $each ($DVY_VehName + $each)`;}
				parent $Groups[$i+$k+$b] $GroupV_A[$j+6+$b]; 				
			 	parent $Sel $Groups[$i+$k+$b];
		        $j++;	$k++;
			}
			$k = $k - $DVYdata[2] + 1;
		}

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Collect Data for wheel positions.
		
// Collect data for Front Wheel postion and size. 
		
		$WDataFrA = `objectCenter $GroupV_A[4]`;
		$TDataA = `xform -q -bb $GroupV_A[4]`;
	
		for ($s = 3; $s < 9; $s++ )
			{ $WDataFrA[$s] = $TDataA[($s-3)];}
//		print "Front Wheel Data is ";	print $WDataFrA; print "© Davvey..\n";
		
// Collect data for Rear Wheel postion and size. 
		$WDataRrA = `objectCenter $GroupV_A[5]`;
		$TDataA = `xform -q -bb $GroupV_A[5]`;
	
		for ($s = 3; $s < 9; $s++ )
			{ $WDataRrA[$s] = $TDataA[($s-3)];}
//		print "Rear Wheel Data is ";	print $WDataFrA; print "© Davvey..\n";
		
// Collect data for Suspension data. 
		
		$SDataA[0] = ($BDataA[6] * 0.85);
		$SDataA[1] = $BDataA[1];
		$SDataA[2] = $WDataFrA[2];
		$SDataA[5] = $WDataRrA[2];
		
//		print "Suspension Data is ";print $SDataA; print "© Davvey..\n";
		
	float $WhSz[];
	$WhSz[0] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[6] + ".boundingBoxSizeX")`;
	$WhSz[1] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[6] + ".boundingBoxSizeY")`;
	$WhSz[2] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[6] + ".boundingBoxSizeZ")`;
	
//	print "$WhSz is \n";
//	print $WhSz;

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	 Create Rig Controllers

	// Create Vehicle Main Controller.		
	$Temp[0] = `curve -n  ($DVY_VehName + "Rig_ControllerN_1") -d 1
			-p 0.5 0.5 -0.5 -p 0.5 0.5 0.5 -p 0.5 -0.5 0.5 -p 0.5 -0.5 -0.5 
			-p 0.5 0.5 -0.5 -p -0.5 0.5 -0.5 -p -0.5 -0.5 -0.5 -p -0.5 -0.5 0.5
			-p -0.5 0.5 0.5	-p 0.5 0.5 0.5 -p 0.5 -0.5 0.5 -p -0.5 -0.5 0.5
			-p -0.5 -0.5 -0.5 -p 0.5 -0.5 -0.5 -p 0.5 0.5 -0.5 -p -0.5 0.5 -0.5
			-p -0.5 0.5 0.5 -p 0.5 0.5 0.5 -p 0.5 0.5 -0.5
			-k 0 -k 0.1 -k 0.2 -k 0.3 -k 0.4 -k 0.5 -k 0.6 -k 0.7 -k 0.8 -k 0.9
			-k 1 -k 1.1 -k 1.2 -k 1.3 -k 1.4 -k 1.5 -k 1.6 -k 1.7 -k 1.8` ;
	
			scale ($BDataA[6] * 2.25) ($BDataA[7] * 2.30) ($BDataA[8] * 2.25) $Temp[0];
			move 0 ($BDataA[7] * 1.15) 0 $Temp[0];
			CenterPivot;	makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
			$RigControlsA[0] = $Temp[0];
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Vehicle Steering Controller.

		polyTorus -r ($BDataA[6] *0.5) -sr($WhSz[1] * 0.05) -tw 0 -sx 36 -sy 8 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name Steering_ControllerN_1;
		polyCut  -ws 1  -cd "Z" -df 1 -ch 0 Steering_ControllerN_1;
		polyCone -r ($WhSz[1] * 0.1) -h ($WhSz[1] * 0.2) -sx 8 -sy 2 -sz 1 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0;
		setAttr "pCone1.translateX" ($BDataA[6] * 0.5);
		polyCone -r ($WhSz[1] * 0.1) -h ($WhSz[1] * 0.2) -sx 8 -sy 2 -sz 1 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0;
		setAttr "pCone2.translateX" ($BDataA[6] * -0.5);
		select -r pCone1 ; select -add pCone2 ;
		rotate -r -eu -90 0 0 ; move -r 0 0 -1; 
		
	$Temp = `polyUnite -name Steering_ControllerN_1 -ch 0 pCone2 pCone1 Steering_ControllerN_1`;
		$RigControlsA[1] = `rename $Temp[0] ($DVY_VehName + "Steering_ControllerN_1")`;
		move 0 ($BDataA[7] * 2.5) 0 $RigControlsA[1];
			
		setAttr ($RigControlsA[1] + ".translateZ") -1;
		xform -p 1 -rp 0 0 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		xform -p 1 -sp 0 0 1 $RigControlsA[1];			
		makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
		parent $RigControlsA[1] $RigControlsA[0];
		
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Vehicle Ground position Controller.
	
	$Temp = `polyCone -r ($WhSz[1] * 0.125) -h ($WhSz[1] * 0.25) -sx 12 -sy 2 -sz 1 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "GrdConeRef_1")`;
//	createNode implicitCone;
//	$Temp = `pickWalk -d up`;
//	$Temp[0]= `rename cone1 "GrdConeRef_1"`;
	
		
		$RigControlsA[2] = $Temp[0];		
		move -r 0 ($WhSz[1] * 0.125) 0 $RigControlsA[2];
		xform -piv 0 ($WhSz[1] * -0.125) 0 $RigControlsA[2];
		makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
		
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Vehicle Bank Controller.
	
	$Temp = `polyTorus -r ($BDataA[6] * 0.1) -sr ($WhSz[1] * 0.01) -tw 0 -sx 24 -sy 8 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name Torus`;
		setAttr "Torus.scaleX" 4; setAttr "Torus.scaleY" 4; setAttr "Torus.scaleZ" 4;
		polyCut  -ws 1 -cd "Z" -df 1 -ch 1 Torus;
		setAttr "Torus.translateZ" ($BDataA[6] * -0.1); 
		xform -p 1 -rp 0 0 ($BDataA[6] * 0.1) Torus;	 xform -p 1 -sp 0 0 ($BDataA[6] * 0.025) Torus;	
		polyCut  -pcz 0 -cd "Z" -df 1 -ch 1 Torus;
		setAttr "polyCut2.cutPlaneCenterZ" 0;
	
		polyCone -r ($WhSz[1] * 0.1) -h ($WhSz[1] * 0.3) -sx 8 -sy 1 -sz 0 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name Cone1;	
			xform -p 1 -piv 0 ($WhSz[1] * -0.15) 0 Cone1;		
			setAttr "Cone1.rotateX" -90; setAttr "Cone1.rotateY" -20;
			setAttr "Cone1.translateY" ($WhSz[1] * 0.15) ; setAttr "Cone1.translateX" ($BDataA[6] * 0.375);
		
		
		polyCone -r ($WhSz[1] * 0.1) -h ($WhSz[1] * 0.3) -sy 1 -sz 0 -ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name Cone2;		
			xform -p 1 -piv 0 ($WhSz[1] * -0.15) 0 Cone2;		
			setAttr "Cone2.rotateX" -90; setAttr "Cone2.rotateY" 20;
			setAttr "Cone2.translateY" ($WhSz[1] * 0.15) ; setAttr "Cone2.translateX" ($BDataA[6] * -0.375);

		$Temp = `polyUnite -ch 0 Cone2 Cone1 Torus`;
			setAttr ($Temp[0] + ".rotateX") -90;
			scale -r 1.5 1 1;
			select -r $Temp[0] ;
			$Tmp = `duplicate -rr`;
			setAttr ($Tmp[0] + ".rotateY") 90;
	
		$Temp = `polyUnite -name ($DVY_VehName + "Bank_ControllerN_1") -ch 0 $Tmp[0] $Temp[0]`;
			scale -r 1.2 0.5 1.2 ;
			$RigControlsA[3] = ($DVY_VehName + "Bank_ControllerN_1");
			move 0 ($BDataA[7] * 2.75) 0 $RigControlsA[3];
			makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
		
		parent $RigControlsA[3]  $RigControlsA[0];
		select - r $RigControlsA[0];
		makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;	
		
		$Temp = `polySphere -r ($BDataA[6] *0.25)  -sx 12 -sy 12 -ax 0 1 0 -tx 2 -ch 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "VehicleTilt_ControlN_1")` ;
			$RigControlsA[4] = $Temp[0];
			move 0 ($BDataA[7] * 2.5) 0 $RigControlsA[4];
			makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
			parent $RigControlsA[4]  $RigControlsA[0];

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Section to generate and position Rig Controllers for the Front Wheel Ground control cones 

	
	$b = 0;
	$j = 1; $k = 1; $q=1;
		for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++)
			{ $q = 1;
				for ($i=1; $i<$DVYdata[1]+1; $i++)
				{
					$Pos[0] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeX")`;
					$Pos[1] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeY")`;
					$Pos[2] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeZ")`;
				
					$Temp = `polyCone -r ($Pos[1] * 0.125) -h ($Pos[1] * 0.25) -sx 12 -sy 2 -sz 1
						-ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefix[$a] + "_WheelFloor_CtrlN_" + $q++)`;
					
					$RigControlsA[$i+4+$b] = $Temp[0];	
					xform -p 1 -piv 0 ($Pos[1] * 0.125) 0 ;
					delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip y -weight 1 $GroupV_A[$i+5+$b] $RigControlsA[$i+4+$b]`;
//					print ("Ln No 600 and $GroupV_A[" + ($i+5+$b) + "] is "  + $GroupV_A[$i+5+$b]  + "\n");  
//					print ("Ln No 601 and $RIGControlsA[" + ($i+4+$b) + "] is "  + $RigControlsA[$i+4+$b]  + "\n");  
					move -r ($Pos[0] * 0.5 * $k) ($Pos[1] * -0.125) ($Pos[0] * 0.3 * $j);
					makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
				}
			  $j = ($j * -1); $k = ($k * -1);				
			  $b = $DVYdata[1];
			}
		
		$b = ($DVYdata[1] * 2) - 1;
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Section to generate and position Rig Controllers for the Rear Wheel Ground control cones 
 
	$j = 1; $k = 1; $q=1;
		for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++)
			{ $q = 1;
				for ($i=1; $i<$DVYdata[2]+1; $i++)
				{
					$Pos[0] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeX")`;
					$Pos[1] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeY")`;
					$Pos[2] = `getAttr ($GroupV_A[5+$i+$b] + ".boundingBoxSizeZ")`;
				
					$Temp = `polyCone -r ($Pos[1] * 0.125) -h ($Pos[1] * 0.25) -sx 12 -sy 2 -sz 1
						-ax 0 1 0 -ch 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefix[$a] + "_WheelFloor_CtrlN_" + $q++)`;
					
					$RigControlsA[$i+5+$b] = $Temp[0];	
					xform -p 1 -piv 0 ($Pos[1] * 0.125) 0 ;
					delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip y -weight 1 $GroupV_A[$i+6+$b] $RigControlsA[$i+5+$b]`;
//					print ("Ln No 630 and $GroupV_A[" + ($i+6+$b) + "] is "  + $GroupV_A[$i+6+$b]  + "\n");  
//					print ("Ln No 631 and $RIGControlsA[" + ($i+5+$b) + "] is "  + $RigControlsA[$i+5+$b]  + "\n");  
					
					move -r ($Pos[0] * 0.5 * $k) ($Pos[1] * -0.125) ($Pos[0] * 0.3 * $j);
					makeIdentity -apply true -t 1 -r 1 -s 1 -n 0;
				}
			  $j = ($j * -1); $k = ($k * -1);				
			  $b = $b + $DVYdata[2];
			}

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Add Custom Attributes to main rig controller
			
	string $DAttrA[] = {".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($RigControlsA[0] + $Att);}
		
	string $DAttrA[] = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($RigControlsA[1] + $Att);}
		transformLimits -ry -60 60 -ery 1 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".ry", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($RigControlsA[3] + $Att);}
		transformLimits -rx -5 5 -erx 1 1 $RigControlsA[3];
		transformLimits -rz -5 5 -erz 1 1 $RigControlsA[3];

	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true - k false ($Groups[9] + $Att);}
		
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
	for ($i=5; $i<(($DVYdata[1] + $DVYdata[2])*2)+5; $i++) 
		{ for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true - k false ($RigControlsA[$i] + $Att);} }
	
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".ry", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($RigControlsA[4] + $Att);}
		transformLimits -rx -90 90 -erx 1 1 $RigControlsA[4];
		transformLimits -rz -90 90 -erz 1 1 $RigControlsA[4];
		
		parent $RigControlsA[0] $GroupV_A[0];		
		parent $RigControlsA[2] $Groups[0];
		
	select -cl;
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Add custom attributes to Rig Controls for spin, steer and suspension.
	
	if (`attributeExists "Damping" $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at Damping $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln Damping -at double  -min 0 -max 1 -dv 0.5 $RigControlsA[0];

	if (`attributeExists "PistonRange" $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at PistonRange $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln PistonRange -at double  -min 0 -max 100 -dv 25 $RigControlsA[0];
	
	for($each in $DVYAttrA)
	 { if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln $each -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 0 $RigControlsA[0]; }

	if (`attributeExists "AutoSpin" $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at AutoSpin $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln AutoSpin -at double -min -10 -max 10 -dv 0 $RigControlsA[0];

	for($each in $DVYAttrB)
	 { if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
			 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}

	for($each in $DVYAttrC)
	  {	if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
			 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0]; }

	for($each in $DVYAttrD)
	  {	if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
			 addAttr -keyable 0  -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}

	for($each in $DVYAttrE)
	  {	if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
			 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}
	
	for ($i=0; $i<4; $i++)
	  {	for($each in $DVYAttrF)
			{ $each = ($DPrefix[$i] + $each);
				if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
				 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}
				 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$i] + "SuspMin");
				 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$i] + "SuspMax");
	  }
	  
	setAttr ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DVYAttrA[0]) 0;
	setAttr ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DVYAttrA[1]) 1;

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Add custom attributes for extra Wheel Spin for each Wheel Steering Controller.

	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
	  {	
		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[0] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[0] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[0] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) -at double -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];

		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[1] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[1] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[1] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) -at double -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];

		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[0] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[0] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[0] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) -at double  -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];

		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[1] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[1] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[1] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) -at double  -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];
	 }
	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
	  {	
		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[2] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[2] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
	 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[2] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) -at double -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];

		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[3] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[3] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[3] + "AutoRotate_" + $q) -at double -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];
		 
		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[2] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[2] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[2] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) -at double  -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];

		if (`attributeExists ($DPrefix[3] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at ($DPrefix[3] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) $RigControlsA[0];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln ($DPrefix[3] + "WheelSpin_" + $q) -at double  -min -10 -max 10 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[0];
	 }
	 
	if (`attributeExists "FrSteer" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at FrSteer $RigControlsA[1];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln FrSteer -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
	if (`attributeExists "FrSteerRatio" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at FrSteerRatio $RigControlsA[1];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln FrSteerRatio -at double -min -1 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		 
	
	if ($DVYdata[10] > 0)
		{
		if (`attributeExists "FrBogieSteer" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at FrBogieSteer $RigControlsA[1];
			 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln FrBogieSteer -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		if (`attributeExists "FrBogieSteerRatio" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at FrBogieSteerRatio $RigControlsA[1];
			 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln FrBogieSteerRatio -at double -min -1 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		}
		 
	if (`attributeExists "RrSteer" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at RrSteer $RigControlsA[1];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln RrSteer -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 0 $RigControlsA[1];
	if (`attributeExists "RrSteerRatio" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at RrSteerRatio $RigControlsA[1];
		 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln RrSteerRatio -at double -min -1 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		 
	if ($DVYdata[10] > 0)
		{
		if (`attributeExists "RrBogieSteer" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at RrBogieSteer $RigControlsA[1];
			 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln RrBogieSteer -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		if (`attributeExists "RrBogieSteerRatio" $RigControlsA[1]`) deleteAttr -at RrBogieSteerRatio $RigControlsA[1];
			 addAttr -keyable 1 -ln RrBogieSteerRatio -at double -min -1 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[1];
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Add Custom attributes to rig cintrollers
		
	$i =0;
	for($each in $DVYAttrG)
	  {	
		if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[4]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[4];
		if($i<3) { addAttr -keyable true -ln $each  -at bool -min 0 -max 1 -dv 1 $RigControlsA[4];}
		if($i>2) { addAttr -keyable true -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[4];}
	  }
	  
	 for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++)
	  {$q = 1;
		for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
		  {	for($each in $DVYAttrh)
				{ $each = ($DPrefix[$a] + $each + $q);
					if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
					 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}
					 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$a] + "SuspMin" + $q);
					 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$a] + "SuspMax" + $q);
		  }
	  }

	 for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++)
	  {$q = 1;
		for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
		  {	for($each in $DVYAttrh)
				{ $each = ($DPrefix[$a] + $each + $q);
					if (`attributeExists $each $RigControlsA[0]`) deleteAttr -at $each $RigControlsA[0];
					 addAttr -keyable 0 -ln $each -at double $RigControlsA[0];}
					 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$a] + "SuspMin" + $q);
					 setAttr -keyable 0 ($RigControlsA[0] + "." + $DPrefix[$a] + "SuspMax" + $q);
		  }
	  }
	  
	select -cl;	

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Build Main Joint Ccentral structure for Wheels and Suspension.
			 
	$DJntsA[0] = `joint -p 0 $BDataA[4] 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "BodyShell_JnT_1")`;
		$DJntsA[1] = `joint -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "Grd_JnT_1")`;
			select -r $DJntsA[0];
			$DJntsA[2] = `joint -p 0 $WDataFrA[1] 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "Cn_Wheel_JnT_1")`;
				select -r $DJntsA[0];
				$DJntsA[3] = `joint -p 0 $BDataA[1] 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + "Cn_Susp_JnT_1")`;
					select -r $DJntsA[2];	
					$DJntsA[4] = `joint -p 0 $WDataFrA[1] (getAttr ($GroupV_A[4] + ".boundingBoxCenterZ")) 
						-name ($DVY_VehName + "CnFr_Wheel_JnT_1")`;
						select -r $DJntsA[2];	
						$DJntsA[5] = `joint -p 0 $WDataFrA[1] (getAttr ($GroupV_A[5] + ".boundingBoxCenterZ")) 
							-name ($DVY_VehName + "CnRr_Wheel_JnT_1")`;
							select -r $DJntsA[3];
							$DJntsA[6] = `joint -p 0 $BDataA[1] (getAttr ($GroupV_A[4] + ".boundingBoxCenterZ")) 
								-name ($DVY_VehName + "FrCn_Susp_JnT_1")`;
								select -r $DJntsA[3];
								$DJntsA[7] = `joint -p 0 $BDataA[1] (getAttr ($GroupV_A[5] + ".boundingBoxCenterZ")) 
									-name ($DVY_VehName + "RrCn_Susp_JnT_1")`;
	
			parent $DJntsA[0] $Groups[7];

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Joints for Front Wheels and Suspension units.	

	$i = 0; $s = 1; $j = 10; $k = 0; $q = 1; $r = 1;
	select -r $DJntsA[4];
	for ($a = 0; $a<$DVYdata[1]; $a++)
	{
		for ($i = 1; $i < 3 ; $i++)
		 {
			$WDataFrA = `objectCenter $GroupV_A[$a+6]`;
			$TDataA = `xform -q -bb $GroupV_A[$a+6]`;
			for ($t = 3; $t < 9; $t++ )
				{ $WDataFrA[$t] = $TDataA[($t-3)];}
//		print ("Front $GroupV_A[" + ($a+6) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+6] + "\n");
				
		  select -r $DJntsA[4];
			$DJntsA[($r * $j)] = `joint -p (1 * $s) $WDataFrA[1]  $WDataFrA[2] 
				-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i-1] + $WJntA[0] + $q)`;
				$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 1] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.8) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
					-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $WJntA[1] + $q)`;	
					$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 2] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
						-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $WJntA[2] + $q)`;	
						$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 3] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[0] * $s) $WDataRrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
							-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $WJntA[3] + $q)`;;
							$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 4] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[6] * $s) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
								-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $WJntA[4] + $q)`;
		
		 select -r $DJntsA[6];	
			$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 5] = `joint -p (1 * $s) $BDataA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
				-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $SJntA[0] + $q)`;
				$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 6] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.6) $BDataA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
					-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $SJntA[1] + $q)`;
					$DJntsA[($r++ * $j) + 7] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.8) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
						-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i-1)] + $SJntA[2] + $q)`;
			
			$s = ($s * -1); $k++;
//			print ($i + " " + $j + " " + $k + "\n");
		}
		$q++;
	}
//	 print ("$r is " + $r + "\n");

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Create Joints for Rear Wheels and Suspension units.	
		
	$i = 0; $s = 1; $j = 10; $k = 2; $q = 1;
		$b = $DVYdata[1] * 2;

	select -r $DJntsA[4];
	
	for ($a = 0; $a<$DVYdata[2]; $a++)
	{
		for ($i = 1; $i < 3 ; $i++)
		 {
			$WDataFrA = `objectCenter $GroupV_A[$a+6+$b]`;
			$TDataA = `xform -q -bb $GroupV_A[$a+6+$b]`;
		
			for ($t = 3; $t < 9; $t++ )
				{ $WDataFrA[$t] = $TDataA[($t-3)];}
//		print ("Rear $GroupV_A[" + ($a+6+$b) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+6+$b] + "\n");
				
		  select -r $DJntsA[5];
			$DJntsA[($r * $j)] = `joint -p (1 * $s) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
				-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i+1] + $WJntA[0] + $q)`;
				$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 1] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.8) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
					-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $WJntA[1] + $q)`;	
					$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 2] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
						-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $WJntA[2] + $q)`;	
						$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 3] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[0] * $s) $WDataRrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
							-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $WJntA[3] + $q)`;;
							$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 4] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[6] * $s) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
								-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $WJntA[4] + $q)`;
		
		 select -r $DJntsA[7];	
			$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 5] = `joint -p (1 * $s) $BDataA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
				-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $SJntA[0] + $q)`;
				$DJntsA[($r * $j) + 6] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.6) $BDataA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
					-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $SJntA[1] + $q)`;
					$DJntsA[($r++ * $j) + 7] = `joint -p ($WDataFrA[3] * $s * 0.8) $WDataFrA[1] $WDataFrA[2] 
						-name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[($i+1)] + $SJntA[2] + $q)`;
		
			$s = ($s * -1); $k++;
//			print ($i + " " + $j + " " + $k + "\n");
		}
		$q++;
	}
//	print ("$r is now " + $r + "\n");
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Section to create and set locators for all Front joint controls.
	
	$i = 0; $j = 0; $k = 1; $s = 0; $r = 1;
	$a = 0; $b = 1; $q = 1;

	for ($k=1; $k<$DVYdata[1]+1; $k++)
		{
		for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++)
			{$j = 0; $l = 0; $s = 0;
				for ($i = 0; $i < 8 ; $i++)
					{			
					  if (`objExists $DJntsA[$r*10*$b+$i]`)
						{
						 if ($s < 5 ) {$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + $WLocA[$j] + $q)`; $j++;}
						 else
							 {$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + $SLocA[$l] + $q)`;	$l++;}
						 	   $DLocs[$r*10*$b+$i] = $Temp[0];
							   select -r $DJntsA[$r*10*$b+$i]; select -add $DLocs[$r*10*$b+$i];
						 	   delete `parentConstraint -weight 1`;
						 }
						  $s++; 
					}
				$b++;
			}
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Section to create and set locators for all Rear joint controls.
		
	$i = 0; $j = 0; $k = 1; $s = 0; $r = 1;
	$a = 2; $q = 1;

	for ($k=1; $k<$DVYdata[2]+1; $k++)
		{
		for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++)
			{$j = 0; $l = 0; $s = 0;
				for ($i = 0; $i < 8 ; $i++)
					{			
					  if (`objExists $DJntsA[$r*10*$b+$i]`)
						{
						 if ($s < 5 ) {$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + $WLocA[$j] + $q)`; $j++;}
						 else
							 {$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + $SLocA[$l] + $q)`;	$l++;}
						 	   $DLocs[$r*10*$b+$i] = $Temp[0];
							   select -r $DJntsA[$r*10*$b+$i]; select -add $DLocs[$r*10*$b+$i];
						 	   delete `parentConstraint -weight 1`;
						 }
						  $s++; 
					}
				$b++;
			}
		}
		
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //

// ******************************************************************************** //	
		
	$q = 1; $j=0; $r = 0;
	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
	{$b=1;
		for ($i = 1; $i < 2; $i++)
			{
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i-1] + $SLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] = $Temp[0];
				delete `parentConstraint -skipTranslate y -weight 1 $DLocs[$i*10*$q+3+$r] $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r]`;	
				parent $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] $Groups[1];
	
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i-1] + $WLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+8+$r] = $Temp[0];
			}$r = $r+10;
	}
	
	$r = 10 ;
//	print ("$r is " + $r + "\n");	
	
	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
	{$b=1;
		for ($i = 1; $i < 2; $i++)
			{
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i] + $SLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] = $Temp[0];
				delete `parentConstraint -skipTranslate y -weight 1 $DLocs[$i*10*$q+3+$r] $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r]`;	
				parent $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] $Groups[1];
	
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i] + $WLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+8+$r] = $Temp[0];
			}$r = $r+10;
	}
	
	$r = $DVYdata[1]*2*10;
//	print ("$r is " + $r + "\n");	

	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
	{$b=1;
		for ($i = 1; $i < 2; $i++)
			{
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i+1] + $SLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] = $Temp[0];
				delete `parentConstraint -skipTranslate y -weight 1 $DLocs[$i*10*$q+3+$r] $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r]`;	
				parent $DLocs[$i*10*$q+9+$r] $Groups[1];
	
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i+1] + $WLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+8+$r] = $Temp[0];
			}$r = $r+10;
	}
	
//	print ("$r is " + $r + "\n");	
	$r= $DVYdata[1]*2*10;
//	print ("$r is " + $r + "\n");	
	
	for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
	{$b=1;
		for ($i = 1; $i < 2; $i++)
			{
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i+2] + $SLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+19+$r] = $Temp[0];
				delete `parentConstraint -skipTranslate y -weight 1 $DLocs[$i*10*$q+3+$r] $DLocs[$i*10*$q+19+$r]`;	
				parent $DLocs[$i*10*$q+19+$r] $Groups[1];
	
				$Temp = `spaceLocator -p 0 0 0 -name ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$i+2] + $WLocA[5] + $q)`;
				$DLocs[$i*10*$q+18+$r] = $Temp[0];
			}$r = $r+10;
	}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
/*
		print ("$DJntsA is:- \n"); $a=0;
		for ($each in $DJntsA)	{print ("$DJntsA[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
		print (" © Davvey..\n");


		print ("$DLocs is:- \n"); $a=0;
		for ($each in $DLocs)	{print ("$DLocs[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
		print (" © Davvey..\n");


		print ("$GroupV_A is:- \n"); $a=0;
		for ($each in $GroupV_A)	{print ("$GroupV_A[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
		print (" © Davvey..\n");
		
		print ("$Groups is:- \n"); $a=0;
		for ($each in $Groups)	{print ("$Groups[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
		print (" © Davvey..\n");

		print ("$RigControlsA is:- \n"); $a=0;
		for ($each in $RigControlsA)	{print ("$RigControlsA[" + $a++ + "] is " + $each + "\n"); }
		print (" © Davvey..\n");
*/
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Parent the Wheel Locators to their respective Group Node

	for ($a=1; $a< ($DVYdata[1]+$DVYdata[2])*2+1;$a++)
		{
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Move Suspension LocatorA to line up with Bodyshell joint and top suspension pivot points.
			
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip x -skip z -weight 1 $DJntsA[0] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 5]`;
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip y -weight 1 $DLocs[($a * 10) + 6] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 5]`;
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Move the Wheel Ground Locators to line up with Suspension LocatorA and ground level.
			
			delete `parentConstraint -skipTranslate y -weight 1 $DLocs[($a * 10) + 9] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 8]`;	
			delete `pointConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip y -weight 1 $DLocs[($a * 10) + 5] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 8]`;
			pointConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DLocs[($a * 10) + 9] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 8];
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Parent the Wheel Locators to their respective Group Node
			
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 4] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 3] ;
		  	parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 3] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 2] ;
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 2] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 1] ;
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 1] $DLocs[($a * 10) + 0] ;
//			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 0] $Groups[3];
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Parent the Suspension Locators to their respective Group Node.
			
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 5] $Groups[6];
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 6] $Groups[2];
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 7] $Groups[2];
			parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 8] $Groups[1];
			
		}
		
	for ($a=1; $a < ($DVYdata[1]*2)+1; $a++)
		{parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 0] $Groups[4];}
		
	$b = $a;	
	
	for ($a=$b; $a < $b+($DVYdata[2]*2); $a++)
		{parent $DLocs[($a * 10) + 0] $Groups[5];}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Parent Constrain each Suspension GrdLocator to control Box.
		
		
	$b = 0; $c = 0;
		
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[1]+1; $a++)
		{
				parent $RigControlsA[$a+4] $Groups[1];
				parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[$a+4] $DLocs[$a*20-1] ;
				print ("$RigControlsA[" + ($a+4) + "] is " + $RigControlsA[$a+4] + " and " 
					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*20-1) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*20-1] + "\n");
		}
	 $c = $DVYdata[1];	
//	print ("$c is " + $c + "\n");	

	 for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[1]+1; $a++)
		{
				parent $RigControlsA[$a+4+$c] $Groups[1];
				parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[$a+4+$c] $DLocs[$a*20+9] ;
				print ("$RigControlsA[" + ($a+4+$c) + "] is " + $RigControlsA[$a+4+$c] + " and " 
					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*20+9) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*20+9] + "\n");
		}

	$c = $a+4+$c-1; $b = $DVYdata[1]*2; $r = 0;
//	print ("$c is " + $c + "\n");	
//	print ("$b is " + $b + "\n");	
	
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[2]+1; $a++)
		{
				parent $RigControlsA[$a+$c] $Groups[1];
				parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[$a+$c] $DLocs[($a+$b)*10+9+$r] ;
				print ("$RigControlsA[" + ($a+$c) + "] is " + $RigControlsA[$a+$c] + " and " 
				+ "$DLocs[" + (($a+$b)*10+9+$r) + "] is " + $DLocs[($a+$b)*10+9+$r] + "\n");
				$r = $r+10;
		}
	
	$c = $c+$DVYdata[2]; $b = $DVYdata[1];
	
//	print ("$c is now" + $c + "\n");	
//	print ("$b is " + $b + "\n");	
	
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[2]+1; $a++)
		{
				parent $RigControlsA[$a+$c] $Groups[1];
				parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[$a+$c] $DLocs[($a+$b)*20+9] ;
				print ("$RigControlsA[" + ($a+$c) + "] is " + $RigControlsA[$a+$c] + " and " 
					+ "$DLocs[" + (($a+$b)*20+9) + "] is " + $DLocs[($a+$b)*20+9] + "\n");
				$r = $r+10;
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Point Constrain the wheel joints to their respective Locators.
		
	for ($a=1; $a<($DVYdata[1]+$DVYdata[2])*2+1; $a++)
		{
			
			pointConstraint -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+2] $DJntsA[$a*10+2];
			pointConstraint -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+3] $DJntsA[$a*10+3];
			pointConstraint -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+4] $DJntsA[$a*10+4];
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
// Parent Constrain each wheel group Top Node to its respective Locator 
// Orient and point Constrain the Wheel Rotate Group nodes to their respective joints e.g. LfFr_Wheel D Joint.
			
		$b = 0; $c = 0;
		
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[1]+1; $a++)
		{
			parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] $GroupV_A[$a+5];
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($a+5) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+5] + " and " 
//					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*10+4+$b) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] + "\n");
			$b= $b+10;
			
		}
		$c = $DVYdata[1]; $b = 10;
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[1]+1; $a++)
		{
			parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c];
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($a+5+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c] + " and " 
//					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*10+4+$b) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] + "\n");
			$b= $b+10;
		}

	$c = $DVYdata[1]*2; $b = $DVYdata[1]*20;
	
//	print ("$b is " + $b + "\n");	
		
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[2]+1; $a++)
		{
			parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c];
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($a+5+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c] + " and " 
//					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*10+4+$b) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*10+4+$b] + "\n");
			$b= $b+10;
		}

	$c = $DVYdata[1]*2+$DVYdata[2]; $b = $DVYdata[1]*2*10;

//	print ("$b is " + $b + "\n");	
		
	for ($a=1; $a<$DVYdata[2]+1; $a++)
		{
			parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DLocs[$a*10+14+$b] $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c];
//				print ("$GroupV_A[" + ($a+5+$c) + "] is " + $GroupV_A[$a+5+$c] + " and " 
//					+ "$DLocs[" + ($a*10+14+$b) + "] is " + $DLocs[$a*10+14+$b] + "\n");
			$b= $b+10;
		}
		
// Orient and point Constrain the Wheel Rotate Group nodes to their respective joints e.g. LfFr_Wheel D Joint.
	
	for ($a=1; $a<($DVYdata[1]+$DVYdata[2])*2+1; $a++)
		{
			orientConstraint -offset 0 0 0 -skip y -skip z -weight 1 $DJntsA[$a*10+3] $Groups[$a+9] ;
//			print ("$Groups[" + ($a+9) + "] is " + $Groups[$a+9] + " and " 
//				+ "$DJntsA[" + ($a*10+3) + "] is " + $DJntsA[$a*10+3] + "\n");
			
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	transformLimits -rx -10 10 -erx 1 1  $GroupV_A[2];
	transformLimits -rz -10 10 -erz 1 1  $GroupV_A[2];
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[0] $GroupV_A[1];
	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $RigControlsA[0] $DJntsA[0];
	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $DJntsA[0] $Groups[6];
	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $GroupV_A[1] $Groups[0];
	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $GroupV_A[1] $Groups[2];
	parentConstraint -mo -weight 1 $GroupV_A[1] $Groups[3];
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	DVY_Suspension_SetUp;
	
	DVY_VehicleBank;	
	
	DVY_Steering;

	DVY_WheelSpin;
	
	DVY_Move;
	
	DVY_VehicleRotate;
	
	DVY_VehicleTilter;
	
	if ((`checkBoxGrp -q -value1 DoorsOptionsCheck` == 1) || (`checkBoxGrp -q -value2 DoorsOptionsCheck` == 1) )
		{ DVY_BodyDoor;}
		
	if ((`checkBoxGrp -q -value1 HoodsOptionsCheck` == 1) || (`checkBoxGrp -q -value2 HoodsOptionsCheck` == 1)
		|| (`checkBoxGrp -q -value3 HoodsOptionsCheck` == 1) || (`checkBoxGrp -q -value4 HoodsOptionsCheck` == 1))
		{ DVY_BodyHoodTrunk;}

	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	select -r $RigControlsA[0]; reorder -relative -9 $RigControlsA[0] ;
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "Joints_GrpN_1");   	reorder -relative -6 ($DVY_VehName + "Joints_GrpN_1") ;
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "Wheel_LocGrpN_1"); 	reorder -relative -3 ($DVY_VehName + "Wheel_LocGrpN_1") ;
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "Dummy_GrpN_1"); 	reorder -relative 2 ($DVY_VehName + "Dummy_GrpN_1") ;
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Lock off all unrequired Geom transform Attribues.
		
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		
	select -r -hi $GroupV_A[2];	$DVYSel = `ls -et transform -sl`;
	for ($each in $DVYSel) { for ($Att in $DAttrA){setAttr -l true - k false ($each + $Att);}  }
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Lock off all unrequired Main Wheel Joint Attribues.
			
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
	
	for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true - k false ($DJntsA[2]+ $Att);} 
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Lock off all unrequired Centre Front and Rear Wheel Joint Attribues.
	
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};

	for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true - k false ($DJntsA[4] + $Att);} 
	for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true - k false ($DJntsA[5] + $Att);} 
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
//	Lock off all unrequired Front and Rear Wheel Joint chain Attribues.
	
	$i = 1; $j = 10; $k = 0;
	$q = ($DVYdata[1] + $DVYdata[2]) * 2 ;
	
	for ($k=0; $k<$q; $k++)
	 {
		for ($i = 0; $i < 5 ; $i++)
		 {
			$Sel = `select - r $DJntsA[($i + $j)]`; 
			for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($Sel[0] + $Att);}
//			print ("Wheel Joint " + $DJntsA[($i + $j)]+ " Locked off. Davvey © 2006..\n");
		 }
		 
 		$j = ($j + 10);
	}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz", ".v"};
	
	for ($each in $DLocs)
		{if (`objExists $each`)
			{ for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true-k false ($each + $Att);}
			}
		}
	  		
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "Cn_Rotate_LocA_1") ;
		select -add ($DVY_VehName + "RrCn_Rotate_LocA_1") ;
			select -add ($DVY_VehName + "FrCn_Rotate_LocA_1") ;
		$Sel = `ls - sl`;
		for ($each in $Sel)
			{ for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true-k false ($each + $Att);} }
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".ty", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		
	for ($i = 0; $i < 9; $i++) 
		{ $each = `select -r $Groups[$i]`;
		  for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false ($each + $Att);}
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	$DAttrB = {".sx", ".sy", ".sz"};
		for ($Att in $DAttrA)
			{setAttr -l true -k false ($GroupV_A[1] + $Att);}
 		for ($Att in $DAttrB)
			{setAttr -l false -k false -cb 1 ($GroupV_A[1] + $Att);}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz", ".v"};

	for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++)
		{ $q = 1;
			for ($q=1; $q< $DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
			{
				for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false 
					($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "WheelFloor_CtrlN_" + $q + $Att);}
				for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false 
					($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "GrdConeRef_" + $q + $Att);}
			}
		}
	
	for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++)
		{ $q = 1;
			for ($q=1; $q< $DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
			{
				for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false
					($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "WheelFloor_CtrlN_" + $q + $Att);}
				for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true -k false
					($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "GrdConeRef_" + $q + $Att);}
			}
		}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
		
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_Suspen_GrpN_1") ;
		select -add ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_Fr_Susp_GrpN_1") ;
			select -add ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_Rr_Susp_GrpN_1") ;

/*	for ($q=1; $DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
		{
			if (`objExists ("Loc_LfFr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q)`) {select -add ("Loc_LfFr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q) ;} 
			if (`objExists ("Loc_RtFr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q)`) {select -add ("Loc_RtFr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q) ;} 
		}
				
	for ($q=1; $DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
		{
			if (`objExists ("Loc_LfRr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q)`) {select -add ("Loc_LfRr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q) ;} 
			if (`objExists ("Loc_RtRr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q)`) {select -add ("Loc_RtRr_Susp_Susp_GrpN_" + $q) ;} 
		}
*/			
	select -add ($DVY_VehName + "VehcileTilter_GrpN_1 ");
	select -add ($DVY_VehName + "Loc_VehcileTilt_GrpN_1") ;
	select -add $LChier[155] ;
	select -add $LChier[150] ;	select -add $LChier[151] ;
	select -add $LChier[152] ;	select -add $LChier[153] ;
		
	$Sel = `ls -sl`;
		
	$DAttrA = {".tx", ".tz", ".rx", ".ry", ".rz", ".sx", ".sy", ".sz", ".v"};
	for ($each in $Sel){ for ($Att in $DAttrA) {setAttr -l true-k false ($each + $Att);} }
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

//	print $RigControlsA;
//	print "\n \n";
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	select -r $RigControlsA;
	editDisplayLayerMembers RigControlLayer `ls -selection`;
	
	for ($i = 1; $i < `size $RigControlsA`; $i++)
 		{
			disconnectAttr "RigControlLayer.drawInfo" ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.drawOverride");
		 	setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideEnabled") 1;
		  	setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideShading") 0;
		  	setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideDisplayType") 0;
		  	setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overridePlayback") 0;
		}

//		setAttr ($RigControlsA[0] + "Shape.overrideColor") 17;
		setAttr ($RigControlsA[1] + "Shape.overrideColor") 16;
		setAttr ($RigControlsA[2] + "Shape.overrideColor") 2;
		setAttr ($RigControlsA[3] + "Shape.overrideColor") 24;
		
		$a = $DVYdata[1]*2;
		
		for ($i=5; $i<5+$DVYdata[1]; $i++)
			{ setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideColor") 13;}
			
		for ($i=5+$DVYdata[1]; $i<5+($DVYdata[1]*2); $i++)
			{ setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideColor") 6;}
			
		for ($i=5+$a; $i<5+$a+$DVYdata[2]; $i++)
			{ setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideColor") 13;}
			
		for ($i=5+$a+$DVYdata[2]; $i<5+$a+($DVYdata[2]*2); $i++)
			{ setAttr ($RigControlsA[$i] + "Shape.overrideColor") 6;}
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	select -r -hi $GroupV_A[1];
	editDisplayLayerMembers GeomLayer `ls -geometry -sl`;
	
	select -r -hi $Groups[7];
	editDisplayLayerMembers JointsLayer `ls -et joint -sl`;
	
	select -r -hi $GroupV_A[1]; 
	editDisplayLayerMembers LocatorsLayer `ls -et locator -sl`;
	
	select -r ($DVY_VehName + "VehcileTilter_GrpN_1 ");
	editDisplayLayerMembers LocatorsLayer `ls -sl`;
	
	select -cl;
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	for ($a=0; $a<2; $a++) 
		{
		 for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[1]+1; $q++)
				{ select -add ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "GrdConeRef_" + $q);}
		}
		
	for ($a=2; $a<4; $a++) 
		{
		 for ($q=1; $q<$DVYdata[2]+1; $q++)
				{ select -add ($DVY_VehName + $DPrefixSp[$a] + "GrdConeRef_" + $q);}
		}
		
	editDisplayLayerMembers LocatorsLayer `ls -selection`;
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	
	
//	print $GroupV_A; print "\n";
	
	$i = 0;
	
//	print $Groups; print "\n";
	
//	print $LocGroups; print "\n";
	
//	print $DVY_MuSuspGrp; print "\n";
	
//	print $DLocs; print "\n";
	
//	print $DJntsA; print "\n";

//	print $RigControlsA;	print "\n";
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

/*	
		for ($each in $DLocs)
			{
			 print ($DJntsA[$idx] + " index No. "  + $idx + " is located at " + $each + "\n");
			  $idx++;
			}
	for ($each in $DLocs) { $LChier[$idx] = $each; $idx++; print ("$LChier[" + $idx + "] is " + $LChier[$idx] + "\n");}
	for ($each in $DJntsA) { $JThier[$idx] = $each; $idx++; print ("$JThier[" + $idx + "] is " + $JThier[$idx] + "\n");}
*/
	
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- //
	
// ******************************************************************************** //	

	print "Vehicle has been rigged ready for use. See help file for instructions on use. Davvey © 2006..\n";

	select -r $RigControlsA[0];

 }	// End of DVY_RigVehicle proc.
